#. y4:msg_speaker_id=31
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Break Things Up
msgctxt "1100_Other Street Punk"
msgid "I don't know what kind of disco reject you're supposed to be, but you're both in for a beating!"
msgstr "¡No sé de que tipo de discoteca sales, pero les voy\na dar a los dos una buena!"

